 bed/1 bath FURNISHED unit at Fairview VW offers an open concept functional layout of 587 sqft luxurious living space. Enjoy the abundance of natural light from its floor-to-ceiling windows and wide plank, rich dark laminate flooring throughout. The open-concept kitchen features quartz countertops, soft close cabinetry complemented with a luxurious slate backsplash and stainless-steel appliances. Step outside on the spacious covered south-facing patio and soak up the views of the mature palm trees and red maples that give the oasis of greenery. Immerse yourself in the convenience of the neighbourhood with its proximity to public transportation, VGH, several parks, restaurants and shopping, and minutes away from Downtown Vancouver. (id:67604)"},"30254404":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639262986540370000/reb89/highres/1/R3163271_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639262986538230000/reb89/highres/1/R3163271_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639262986533400000/reb89/highres/1/R3163271_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639262986523100000/reb89/highres/1/R3163271_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639262986556430000/reb89/highres/1/R3163271_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639262986523300000/reb89/highres/1/R3163271_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639262986523100000/reb89/highres/1/R3163271_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639262986528230000/reb89/highres/1/R3163271_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639262986551570000/reb89/highres/1/R3163271_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639262986540370000/reb89/highres/1/R3163271_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639262986523100000/reb89/highres/1/R3163271_11.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639262986523300000/reb89/highres/1/R3163271_12.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639262986551570000/reb89/highres/1/R3163271_13.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639262986552400000/reb89/highres/1/R316