en features premium Italian Snaidero cabinetry and is outfitted with top-of-the-line Miele and Sub-Zero appliances, offering both style and performance for modern living. (id:67604)"},"30480916":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639294190739800000/reb89/highres/2/R3181482_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639294190739800000/reb89/highres/2/R3181482_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639294190739800000/reb89/highres/2/R3181482_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639294190739800000/reb89/highres/2/R3181482_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639294190739800000/reb89/highres/2/R3181482_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639294190739800000/reb89/highres/2/R3181482_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639294190739800000/reb89/highres/2/R3181482_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639294190739800000/reb89/highres/2/R3181482_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639294190739800000/reb89/highres/2/R3181482_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639294190739800000/reb89/highres/2/R3181482_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639294190739800000/reb89/highres/2/R3181482_11.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639294190739800000/reb89/highres/2/R3181482_12.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639294190739800000/reb89/highres/2/R3181482_13.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639294190739800000/reb89/highres/2/R3181482_14.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639294190739800000/reb89/highres/2/R3181482_15.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639294190739800000/reb89/highres/2/R3181482_16.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639294190739800000/reb89/highres/2/R3181482_17.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639294190739800000/reb89/highres/2/R3181482_18.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639294190739800000/reb89/highres/2/R3181482_19.jpg"],"remarks":"Spacious 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom walk-out basement suite offering approximately 1,250 sq. ft. of comfortable living space in a quiet Coquitlam West cul-de-sac. Features include an updated kitchen, vinyl plank flooring, separate laundry, a private entrance, access to a gated yard and garden area, and street parking. Conveniently located near Miller Park, École Banting Middle School, Como Lake, Poirier Sport & Leisure Complex, local schools, shopping, and transit along Como Lake Avenue. Tenant is responsible for 30% of gas and hydro, plus TV and internet. Minimum one-year lease and tenant insurance required. No pets, smoking, vaping, or subletting. (id:67604)"},"30496612":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306984452000000/reb89/highres/0/R3182630_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306984452070000/reb89/highres/0/R3182630_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306984418870000/reb89/highres/0/R3182630_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306984452770000/reb89/highres/0/R3182630_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306984452030000/reb89/highres/0/R3182630_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306984452100000/reb89/highres/0/R3182630_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306984452100000/reb89/highres/0/R3182630_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306984452000000/reb89/highres/0/R3182630_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306984452600000/reb89/highres/0/R3182630_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306984452000000/reb89/highres/0/R3182630_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306984452030000/reb89/highres/0/R3182630_11.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306984452530000/reb89/highres/0/R3182630_12.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306984452470000/reb89/highres/0/R3182630_13.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306984452870000/reb89/highres/0/R3182630_14.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306984452030000/reb89/highres/0/R3182630_15.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639306984444230000/reb89/highres/0/R3182630_16.jp