bathroom condo on the 6th floor offering approximately 500 sq.ft. of modern living space. Bright and functional layout with quality furnishings, one secure parking stall, and all utilities included (hydro, heat, water, and internet). Excellent location close to shopping, restaurants, parks, public transit, and everyday amenities. Ideal for a single professional or couple seeking a move-in ready home. Available Nov 18.2026. Minimum 1-yearlease preferred. No smoking. Tenant insurance required. Credit, employment, and landlord reference checks required. Pets subject to landlord approval. (id:67604)"},"30505492":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639300742524030000/reb89/highres/7/R3183277_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639300742524030000/reb89/highres/7/R3183277_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639300742524030000/reb89/highres/7/R3183277_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639300742524030000/reb89/highres/7/R3183277_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639300742524030000/reb89/highres/7/R3183277_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639300742524030000/reb89/highres/7/R3183277_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639300742524030000/reb89/highres/7/R3183277_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639300742524030000/reb89/highres/7/R3183277_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639300742524030000/reb89/highres/7/R3183277_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639300742524030000/reb89/highres/7/R3183277_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639300742524030000/reb89/highres/7/R3183277_11.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639300742524030000/reb89/highres/7/R3183277_12.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639300742524030000/reb89/highres/7/R3183277_13.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639300742524030000/reb89/highres/7/R3183277_14.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639300742524030000/reb89/highres/7/R3183277_15.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS6393007425